    <section xml:id="sec-section-1-8">
      <title>Section 08 - Find Orthogonal Vectors and Areas with Cross Products</title>

      <objectives>
  <p><em>Learning Objectives</em></p>
  <ul>
    <li>Find the cross product of two vectors.</li>
    <li>
      Find the cross product of standard unit vectors and use properties of the cross product.
    </li>
    <li>Find the magnitude of a cross product.</li>
    <li>Find a unit vector orthogonal to two given vectors.</li>
    <li>Find the area of a parallelogram or triangle using a cross product.</li>
  </ul>
</objectives>

